    "attributes": {
        "action": "Change plans for Social Media Bans to instead a Law Enforcing Parental Controls",
        "additional_details": "",
        "background": "Instead of banning Social Media as proposed for Under 16's instead create a new law requiring parents to set up Parental Controls on their children's devices. This still secures the safety of children through Parental Responsibility while eliminating online ID Checks for all accessing social media.",
